  "adaptations": [
    "Settings read the existing addon config rather than introducing a second config.",
    "Camera heading reuses the addon publisher and session key.",
    "Network protocol announces server mode, uses FiresGhettoNetworking matching/RTT and disables its own ping probing.",
    "A dedicated server never becomes an eligible simulated owner.",
    "MobPolicy adds the existing addon 250ms relative threshold when the configured ping limit is zero.",
    "NativeContracts uses equivalent plain reflection for startup-only validation.",
    "FiresGhettoNetworking dispatcher and held station hooks reach the unchanged handoff request router.",
    "1.0.10 adds command-only timing setters to AuthorityGrid, OwnershipCadence and AuthorityController. Existing object indexes, guards, request deadlines, cache receipts and handoffs are retained. Settings snapshots expose live timer and fallback fields; no new polling is installed."
  ]
